{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, שְׁמַע","hw":"שְׁמַע","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁמַע</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. hear (</strong>v. BH<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:15\" href=\"/Daniel.6.15\">Dn 6:15</a>; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁמְעֵת</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:14\" href=\"/Daniel.5.14\">5:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:16\" href=\"/Daniel.5.16\">16</a>; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִשְׁמַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:10\" href=\"/Daniel.3.10\">3:10</a>, 2 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּשְׁמְעוּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:5\" href=\"/Daniel.3.5\">3:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:15\" href=\"/Daniel.3.15\">15</a>; Pt. act. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָֽׁמְעִין</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:7\" href=\"/Daniel.3.7\">3:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:23\" href=\"/Daniel.5.23\">5:23</a>;—<em>hear:</em> = <em>have sense of hearing</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:23\" href=\"/Daniel.5.23\">Dn 5:23</a>; c. acc. of sound <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:5\" href=\"/Daniel.3.5\">3:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:7\" href=\"/Daniel.3.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:10\" href=\"/Daniel.3.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:15\" href=\"/Daniel.3.15\">15</a>, word <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:15\" href=\"/Daniel.6.15\">6:15</a>; c. cl. <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּי</span> + <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> pers. <em>concerning</em>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:14\" href=\"/Daniel.5.14\">5:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:16\" href=\"/Daniel.5.16\">16</a>.<br><strong>Hithpe.</strong>  <em>shew oneself obedient:</em> Impf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִשְׁתַּמְעוּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:27\" href=\"/Daniel.7.27\">Dn 7:27</a>, c. ל pers. (prob.).","next":"BDB Aramaic, שָֽׁמְרָ֑יִן","prev":"BDB Aramaic, שְׁמַם"}